cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "Agent Memory Techniques: A Cookbook for LLM Agent Memory"
authors:
  - family-names: "Diamant"
    given-names: "Nir"
repository-code: "https://github.com/NirDiamant/Agent_Memory_Techniques"
url: "https://github.com/NirDiamant/Agent_Memory_Techniques"
abstract: >-
  A hands-on collection of 30 agent memory techniques for LLM
  (Large Language Model) applications, each with a runnable Jupyter
  notebook. Covers short-term, long-term, cognitive architectures,
  retrieval patterns, frameworks, and production patterns.
keywords:
  - agent-memory
  - llm-memory
  - llm-agents
  - memgpt
  - mem0
  - letta
  - zep
  - graphiti
  - rag
  - knowledge-graph
  - episodic-memory
  - cognitive-architecture
license: Apache-2.0
